018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#39;images/球冠，球缺和球锥/c43c5477ea37fbe4d9a2689a57a44608tplv-be4g95zd3a-448x448.jpeg&#39; alt=&#34;image&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
